 "notes": "PARTIAL: release notes for RTS 23.5/24.4 and the My Plates catalog (JS-rendered) could not be read, so some 2023-2026 My Plates vendor designs are probably missing, and TxDMV publishes no plate image gallery, so state-plate images are null. Year-null items (Texas medal plates from HB 4861, Sheriffs' Assn, K9S4KIDS, classroom teacher plates from 88R, Texas Our Texas, Texas Humanitarian Service Medal) are in the Rev 12/2025 guides but not in the game; Texas Our Texas and Texas Humanitarian Service Medal dates unconfirmed. Phi Beta Sigma and Sigma Gamma Rho were added in RTS (2024/2025) yet also appear on My Plates' discontinued list (likely failed pre-orders or an older version). Houston Texans state plate is closed to new orders only; Houston Rockets is on My Plates' discontinued list but the state version remains, so not retired."
